Robin G
Terrific restaurant with attentive staff
May 2, 2026 • Family
Husband and I chose this restaurant primarily because it was across the street from our hotel. What a fortuitous choice! We had a great meal…the salmon with “angry broccoli” for me and the roasted branzino with artichokes for hubby. We also tried the (enormous) order of fingerling potatoes and a shared appetizer of burrata, tomato and prosciutto. The food was incredibly delicious and beautifully presented. Our server, Terry, was attentive and made the experience even better with his knowledge and suggestions. Thank you, Terry! Desserts were a real treat: I enjoyed the B&W sundae (huge, with a big sugar cookie perched on top) while my gluten-free husband loved the macarons and fruit (whimsical presentation- see photo). Coffee Americano wound up the meal. It was as pleasant a dining experience as we have had in a long time. Highly recommend!


